  BranchIntake -->|yields the issue branch namespace| IssueSolution
  MergeTrain -->|merged solution closes the issue| Issue
  PullRequest --> CI
  PullRequest --> CodeQL
  PullRequest --> APIDrift
  PullRequest --> Provenance
  PullRequest --> Conventional
  Conventional --> Guard
  Guard --> PullRequest
  PullRequest --> Docs
  CI --> PRAutomation
  CodeQL --> PRAutomation
  APIDrift --> PRAutomation
  Provenance --> PRAutomation
  Docs --> PRAutomation
  PRAutomation --> Trusted
  Untrusted --> Sandbox
  EphemeralGit --> Sandbox
  Trusted --> Sandbox
  Sandbox --> Review
  PRAutomation -->|fresh heartbeat, not a fork: sovereign lane first| LocalReviewFallback
  LocalReviewFallback -->|trusted author: carries the diff half, paid answers the wider half only| Review
  LocalReviewFallback -->|outside author: held in reserve, paid answers the whole review| Review
  Review -->|paid answer + sovereign verdict| ReviewComposition
  ReviewComposition -->|repairable: the paid half failed| Repair
  ReviewComposition -->|gate names the lane behind each half| MergeTrain
  ReviewComposition -->|the sovereign half alone failed: a lead for a human| FallbackDeclined
  Repair --> Guard
  Review -->|no verdict| ReviewIncomplete
  ReviewIncomplete -->|operator corrects condition, then reruns| Review
  Review -->|no verdict: the sovereign verdict is read as the fallback| LocalReviewFallback
  LocalReviewFallback -->|found nothing blocking: gate (local fallback)| MergeTrain
  LocalReviewFallback -->|unreachable or unusable too| ReviewIncomplete
  LocalReviewFallback -->|declined; its findings count says which| FallbackDeclined
  ReviewContract -->|renders both review --json-schema candidates at install| Install
  ReviewContract -->|diff-groundable half and its placeholders| LocalFallback
  ReviewContract -->|the halves and the wider half's report fields| ReviewComposition
  IssueAutomation -->|paid solve produced nothing| LocalTriageFallback
  LocalTriageFallback -->|bounded triage comment, needs_human forced true| IssueAutomation
  Release -->|after each publish| SupersededReport
  SupersededReport -->|job summary names what to yank and where| TestPyPI
  SupersededReport -->|job summary names what to yank and where| PyPI
  PublishRelease -->|"--governance-since: ratified founding-document change (Article V.4)"| Yank
  Yank -->|"governance override: EVERY previous release named, keep and switches ignored"| SupersededReport
  Maintainer -->|paid lane capped: credits out| LocalAuthority
  LocalAuthority -->|"pre-fetch lease force-with-lease: green local branches reach remotes"| Push
  Maintainer -->|paid IDE probe fails| Failover
  Failover -->|"seat handed to first healthy local agent; reclaimed on paid recovery"| LocalAuthority
